        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: The Weinstein Company, Dimension Films, The Walt Disney Studios\n- Films: Scary Movie 5, Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD\n- People: Katrina Bowden\n\nFacts:\n- Dimension Films is an American film production company and independent film distribution label.\n- Dimension Films was formerly owned by The Walt Disney Studios and is now owned by The Weinstein Company.\n- Scary Movie 5 was distributed by The Weinstein Company under the Dimension Films brand, and it was the second film to be distributed that way.\n- Katrina Bowden appeared in the films Sex Drive, Piranha 3DD, and Scary Movie 5.",
